# Wrath of the Opo-Opos (outlands 160) against Rhapsodies of Zilart 5 at the Yuhtunga headstone. main: the mission
# current, the Fire Fragment held, the quest accepted (GMs): the mission answers nil: the quest's TOUCHING_RED_JEWEL; a
# Garnet: 202, finished: completed; the headstone: the mission's ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG and noAction. bob: the mission
# completed (its rD ZILART_MONUMENT), the quest accepted: the quest's message (50) beats the rD (20).
lists YuhtungaJungle/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger YuhtungaJungle/Cermet_Headstone/onTrade YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/202
char zone=YuhtungaJungle pos=495.415,19.658,303.495 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=YuhtungaJungle pos=495.415,19.658,303.495 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
keyitem FireFragment
quest Outlands.WrathOfTheOpoOpos accepted
item Garnet
bob: mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage completed
bob: quest Outlands.WrathOfTheOpoOpos accepted
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # the mission: nil; the quest: TOUCHING_RED_JEWEL
trade Cermet_Headstone Garnet x1        # 202
finish                                  # completed; the garnet taken
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # the mission: ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG, noAction
bob: login
bob: trigger Cermet_Headstone           # the quest's TOUCHING_RED_JEWEL over the mission's rD ZILART_MONUMENT
